    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "1",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 4,
      "text": "杉木针阔混交林造林技术规程",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L4"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "1 范围",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 6,
      "text": "本文件规定了以杉木[Cunninghamia lanceolata (Lamb.) Hook.]为主要树种，培育针阔混交林的树种",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L6"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 7,
      "text": "选择、新造林、现有林改培、抚育管理等技术要求。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L7"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 8,
      "text": "本文件适用于以杉木为主体的针阔混交林造林。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L8"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 9,
      "text": "2 规范性引用文件",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L9"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 10,
      "text": "下列文件中的内容通过文中的规范性引用而构成本文件必不可少的条款。其中，注日期的引用文件，",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L10"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 11,
      "text": "仅该日期对应的版本适用于本文件；不注日期的引用文件，其最新版本（包括所有的修改单）适用于本",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L11"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 12,
      "text": "文件。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L12"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "GB/T 15776  造林技术规程",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "GB/T 15781  森林抚育规程",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 15,
      "text": "GB/T 15783  主要造林树种林地化学除草技术规程",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L15"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 16,
      "text": "DB44/T 245  主要阔叶树种苗木质量分级",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L16"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 17,
      "text": "3 术语和定义",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L17"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 18,
      "text": "下列术语和定义适用于本文件。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L18"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "杉木针阔混交林 mixed forest of Cunninghamia lanceolata with broad-leaved trees",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 21,
      "text": "以针叶树种杉木为主要树种，搭配一种及以上阔叶树种所形成的针阔混交林（简称“杉阔混交林”），",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L21"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "包括新造杉阔混交林、杉木萌芽更新混交林及杉木间伐套种混交林，其中杉木株数占总株数比例为50%",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "（含）～65%（含）。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 24,
      "text": "4 树种选择",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L24"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "常用树种",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "杉木和乡土阔叶树，常用乡土阔叶树种包括红锥（Castanopsis hystrix Miq.）、木荷（Schima superba",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 27,
      "text": "Gardn. et Champ.）、乐昌含笑（Michelia chapensis Dandy）、火力楠（Michelia macclurei Dandy）等。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L27"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "其他树种",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "其他阔叶树种按GB/T 15776选择，如闽楠[Phoebe bournei (Hemsl.) Yang]、枫香(Liquidambar",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "formosana Hance)等。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 31,
      "text": "种苗质量",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L31"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 5,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "4.3.1 杉木",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P5:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2466—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L1"
    },
    {
