    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "≥",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "综合控制指标",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 15,
      "text": "播种裸根苗",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L15"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 16,
      "text": "1.0-0",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L16"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 17,
      "text": "30",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L17"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 18,
      "text": "0.60",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L18"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 19,
      "text": "苗干直，无分蘖，",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L19"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "充分木质化，叶色紫红",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 21,
      "text": "或灰绿，无损伤，无病",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L21"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "虫害",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "扦插裸根苗",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 24,
      "text": "组培裸根苗",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L24"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "0.35",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "播种容器苗",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 27,
      "text": "1.0-0",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L27"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "20",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "0.35",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "扦插容器苗",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 31,
      "text": "0.45",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L31"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "组培容器苗",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 33,
      "text": "0.25",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L33"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 34,
      "text": "4.3.2 阔叶树",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L34"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 35,
      "text": "宜选用经省级以上林木品种审定机构审(认)定的良种或优良种源种子、优良无性系等。阔叶树苗木",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L35"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 36,
      "text": "质量按DB44/T 245的规定执行，新造杉阔混交林宜用1年～2年生容器苗，现有林改培（含杉木萌芽更新",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L36"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 37,
      "text": "混交林和杉木间伐套种混交林）宜用2年生以上容器苗。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L37"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 38,
      "text": "5 新造林",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L38"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 39,
      "text": "林地选择",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L39"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 40,
      "text": "选择杉木传统种植区中的宜林荒地、采伐或火烧迹地等，土层厚度70 cm以上，土壤类型以黄壤土、",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L40"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 41,
      "text": "红壤土为宜。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L41"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 42,
      "text": "林地准备",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L42"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 43,
      "text": "5.2.1 清理",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L43"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 44,
      "text": "沿等高线进行带状环山清带，带宽0.5 m～1.0 m，可利用杂灌枝条堆积形成带间护坡层。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L44"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 45,
      "text": "5.2.2 整地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L45"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 46,
      "text": "植穴规格（40～50）cm×（40～50）cm×（35～40）cm（长×宽×深）。局部地段坡度35°以上采",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L46"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 47,
      "text": "用穴状整地，清除植穴周围1.0 m～1.2 m范围内的杂草杂灌。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L47"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 48,
      "text": "5.2.3 基肥",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L48"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 49,
      "text": "每穴施过磷酸钙（含P2O5≥12%）300 g～500 g或有机肥（有机质≥ 40%）500 g～1000 g，回表土",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L49"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 50,
      "text": "至一半时混匀肥料，再填满表土。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L50"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 51,
      "text": "混交模式",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L51"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 52,
      "text": "5.3.1 密度",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L52"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 53,
      "text": "中坡及下坡位采用3 m（株距）×(2.5～3.0) m（行距），即1 110 株/hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L53"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 54,
      "text": "2～1 330 株/ hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L54"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 55,
      "text": "2；上坡",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L55"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 56,
      "text": "位2 m（株距）×(2.0～2.5) m（行距），即2 000 株/hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L56"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 57,
      "text": "2～2 500 株/hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L57"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 6,
      "line": 58,
      "text": "2，种间行距宜等于或大于种内",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P6:L58"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2466—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L1"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "3",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 3,
      "text": "行距。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L3"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 4,
      "text": "5.3.2 比例",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L4"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "杉木株数占总株数50%（含）～65%（含）。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 6,
      "text": "5.3.3 方式",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L6"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 7,
      "text": "杉木与一种及以上阔叶树混交宜选择以下方式：",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L7"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 8,
      "text": "a) 行间混交：单行混交、双行混交、双行（杉木）与单行（阔叶树）混交；",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L8"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 9,
      "text": "b) 带状混交：3 行及以上（3 列及以上）杉木与3 行及以上（3 列及以上）阔叶树交替栽植；",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L9"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 10,
      "text": "c) 株间混交：沿种植带杉木1 株～3 株与阔叶树1 株～3 株依次交替混交栽植。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L10"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 11,
      "text": "d) 不规则块状混交：将山地按小地形变化，在不同的地形部位分别成块栽植，每个块状地的面积",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L11"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 12,
      "text": "不宜超过0.067 hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L12"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "2。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "种植",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 15,
      "text": "5.4.1 时间",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L15"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 16,
      "text": "2月至4月上旬雨后土壤湿润时进行栽植，杉木裸根苗需在3月底前完成栽植。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L16"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 17,
      "text": "5.4.2 苗木处理",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L17"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 18,
      "text": "容器苗先除去育苗袋，保持营养土团完整，不损伤根系；杉木裸根苗随起随栽，适当修根、浆根。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L18"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 19,
      "text": "5.4.3 栽植",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L19"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "将苗干直立于穴中央，根系舒展，实生苗栽植深度比苗木根颈位置深2 cm～3 cm，无性系苗栽植深",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 21,
      "text": "度稍深（可至苗高1/3处），回表土至2/3时将苗木稍向上轻提，然后踩紧，再将余土填满踩实，最后覆",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L21"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "盖松土略高于地面。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "6 现有林改培",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 24,
      "text": "培育目标",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L24"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "将现有杉木萌芽林和杉木林改培为杉木萌芽更新混交林和杉木间伐套种混交林。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "林地清理",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 27,
      "text": "在杉木萌芽林内，保留杉木伐桩上健壮的萌芽条1株～2株，清除多余的萌芽条；在待改建的杉木林",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L27"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "内，适时适量抚育采伐部分林木，方法及强度按GB/T 15781执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "整地",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "穴状整地，植穴密度根据保留杉木萌芽条数或杉木株数及该林分所处年龄阶段而定，在林中稀疏处",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 31,
      "text": "或空地可密集植穴，形成5穴～9穴密集群，也可在原种植行带上品字形插入植穴；林木较密集的区域内，",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L31"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "可随机植穴。穴规格按5.2.2执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 33,
      "text": "基肥",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L33"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 7,
      "line": 34,
      "text": "按5.2.3执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P7:L34"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2466—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L1"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "4",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 3,
      "text": "混交方式",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L3"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 4,
      "text": "根据不同混交树种的特性选择以下方式：",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L4"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "a) 行带混交：保留杉木（萌芽条）3 行及以上构成“带”，与其他阔叶树种植行依次种植；",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 6,
      "text": "b) 植生组混交：在杉木（萌芽）林中稀疏处或空地密集种植阔叶树；",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L6"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 7,
      "text": "c) 星状混交：在杉木（萌芽）林分中零星、分散种植阔叶树。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L7"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 8,
      "text": "密度",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L8"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 9,
      "text": "林分密度宜控制在900 株/hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L9"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 10,
      "text": "2～1 650 株/hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L10"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 11,
      "text": "2。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L11"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 12,
      "text": "种植",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L12"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 13,
      "text": "时间按GB/T 15776的规定执行，方法按5.4.3执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L13"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 14,
      "text": "7 抚育管理",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L14"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 15,
      "text": "补植",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L15"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 16,
      "text": "定植后20 d～30 d内，全面检查各个树种成活情况，对缺株、死株、病株进行重新清理，并栽植同",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L16"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 17,
      "text": "种同规格苗木，补植宜在雨季进行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L17"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 18,
      "text": "除草松土",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L18"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 19,
      "text": "造林后3年内实施，每年2次，第1次在5月～6月，全面除草；第2次在8月～10月，带状或块状除草，",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L19"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 20,
      "text": "及时清除目的树种周边1 m以内区域的杂灌、杂草、藤蔓。采用物理方法清除的，留茬高度低于20 cm；",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L20"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 21,
      "text": "采用化学药剂除草的，应执行 GB/T 15783的规定。松土结合除草时进行，在苗木周围50 cm范围内进",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L21"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 22,
      "text": "行，做到里深外浅，不伤害苗木根系。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L22"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 23,
      "text": "定株",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L23"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 24,
      "text": "结合除草松土进行，每穴或每伐桩只保留1条优势直立株。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L24"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 25,
      "text": "追肥",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L25"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 26,
      "text": "造林后3年内每年各施1次，结合除草松土进行（5月～6月）；第1年每株宜追施肥宜复合肥（N、P2O5、",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L26"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 27,
      "text": "K2O的总含量＞25%，其中K2O含量≥4%）100 g～150 g；第2年每株宜追施复合肥（同上）150 g～200 g；",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L27"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 28,
      "text": "第3年每株宜追施复合肥（同上）150 g～250 g。间伐后及时施肥1次～2次，每次每株施复合肥300 g～",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L28"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 29,
      "text": "500 g或有机肥（同上）1 000 g～2 000 g。追肥时，可采取沟施或穴施，在距离树苗30 cm左右内侧开",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L29"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 30,
      "text": "沟或挖穴，均匀追肥后及时覆土。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L30"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 31,
      "text": "间伐",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L31"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 32,
      "text": "根据树种的特性及培育目标，采用下层间伐法适时适度间伐。新造杉阔混交林与杉木萌芽更新混交",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L32"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 33,
      "text": "林，林龄8 a～12 a、郁闭度0.8以上时，进行第一次间伐，遵循砍小留大、砍密留稀、分布均匀原则，",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L33"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 34,
      "text": "保留密度900 株/hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L34"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 35,
      "text": "2～1 400 株/hm",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L35"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 36,
      "text": "2；林龄20 a以上时，可间伐胸径≥25 cm的杉木大径材，阔叶树可长",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L36"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 37,
      "text": "周期培育。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L37"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 8,
      "line": 38,
      "text": "有害生物防治",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P8:L38"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2466—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P9:L1"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 2,
      "text": "5",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P9:L2"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 3,
      "text": "林地综合管护按GB/T 15776执行。杉木赤枯病、炭疽病等可用75%百菌清可湿粉500倍～800倍喷施，",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P9:L3"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 4,
      "text": "其他树种的病虫害防治见《林木有害生物识别与防治图鉴》。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P9:L4"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 5,
      "text": "8 建档",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P9:L5"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 9,
      "line": 6,
      "text": "按GB/T 15776和GB/T 15781的规定执行。",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P9:L6"
    },
    {
      "file": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf",
      "page": 10,
      "line": 1,
      "text": "DB44/T 2466—2024",
      "ref_id": "DB44_T+2466-2024.pdf:P10:L1"
